<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome to FEPODRA Attendance Portal</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-green: #006633;
            --dark-green: #004d26;
            --accent-gold: #ffc107;
            --light-bg: #f8f9fa;
            --text-color: #333333;
            --card-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
        }
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(0, 51, 26, 0.8), rgba(0, 51, 26, 0.85)), 
                        url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1541339907198-e08756dedf3f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1920&q=80') no-repeat center center fixed;
            background-size: cover;
            color: var(--text-color);
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }
        /* Header / Navbar */
        header {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
            padding: 18px 50px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,102,51,0.1);
        }
        .logo-area {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 15px;
        }
        .logo-area h1 {
            font-size: 20px;
            color: var(--primary-green);
            margin: 0;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }
        .login-nav-btn {
            background: var(--primary-green);
            color: white;
            padding: 10px 24px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 14px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0,102,51,0.2);
        }
        .login-nav-btn:hover {
            background: var(--dark-green);
            transform: translateY(-1px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 15px rgba(0,102,51,0.3);
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 70px 50px;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            gap: 50px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .hero-text {
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 320px;
            color: white;
        }
        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: rgba(255, 193, 7, 0.2);
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 193, 7, 0.3);
        }
        .hero-text h2 {
            font-size: 40px;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            line-height: 1.15;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
        }
        .hero-text p {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #e2e8f0;
            margin-bottom: 35px;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }
        .cta-btn {
            background: var(--accent-gold);
            color: #111;
            padding: 16px 36px;
            font-size: 16px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 700;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .cta-btn:hover {
            background: #e0a800;
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
        }

        /* Hero Images Gallery Container */
        .hero-images {
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 320px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 20px;
        }
        .hero-image-card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            text-align: center;
        }
        .hero-image-card img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 200px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 10px;
            display: block;
        }
        .image-caption {
            margin-top: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
            color: #333;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        /* Features Section */
        .features {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            padding: 80px 50px;
            text-align: center;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
        }
        .features h3 {
            color: var(--dark-green);
            font-size: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .features-subtitle {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 16px;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto 50px auto;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        .feature-grid {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 30px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .feature-card {
            background: var(--light-bg);
            padding: 35px 30px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            width: 300px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
            text-align: left;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
            border: 1px solid #eaeaea;
        }
        .feature-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
            border-color: rgba(0,102,51,0.2);
        }
        .feature-card h4 {
            color: var(--primary-green);
            margin-top: 0;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .feature-card p {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin: 0;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Meet the Project Team Section */
        .team-section {
            background: #f1f5f9;
            padding: 80px 50px;
            text-align: center;
            border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        }
        .team-section h3 {
            color: var(--dark-green);
            font-size: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .team-subtitle {
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        .team-grid {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 30px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .team-card {
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 25px 20px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            width: 280px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            text-align: center;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        }
        .team-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .team-card img {
            width: 120px;
            height: 120px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            object-fit: cover;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            border: 3px solid var(--primary-green);
        }
        .team-card h4 {
            color: var(--primary-green);
            margin: 0 0 5px 0;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .team-card .dept {
            color: #475569;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin: 0;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px;
            color: #ccc;
            font-size: 13px;
            background: rgba(0, 34, 17, 0.95);
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero { padding: 40px 20px; text-align: center; justify-content: center; }
            header { padding: 15px 20px; }
            .hero-text h2 { font-size: 32px; }
            .features, .team-section { padding: 50px 20px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Navbar -->
    <header>
        <div class="logo-area">
            <h1>FEPODRA Attendance</h1>
        </div>
        <a href="/login" class="login-nav-btn">Login to Portal</a>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-text">
            <span class="badge">Federal Polytechnic, Daura</span>
            <h2>Smart QR Code Attendance Management System</h2>
            <p>An advanced digital solution designed to streamline classroom attendance tracking at Federal Polytechnic, Daura. Students can effortlessly scan verification codes in real-time while the system securely records metrics instantly.</p>
            <a href="/login" class="cta-btn">Get Started / Login →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-images">
            <!-- First Image: Student scanning/using smartphone -->
            <div class="hero-image-card">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1531482615713-2afd69097998?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Student scanning QR code">
                <div class="image-caption">📱 Student scanning session attendance via mobile</div>
            </div>
            <!-- Second Image: Classroom / Lecturer context -->
            <div class="hero-image-card">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1524178232363-1fb2b075b655?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Lecturer and students interacting in a modern classroom">
                <div class="image-caption">🎓 Interactive Classroom & Automated Attendance Logs</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Features Section -->
    <section class="features">
        <h3>Core System Features</h3>
        <p class="features-subtitle">Built with high reliability, security, and speed to empower academic monitoring.</p>
        <div class="feature-grid">
            <div class="feature-card">
                <h4>⚡ Real-Time Scanning</h4>
                <p>Lecturers can generate secure, time-bound 5-minute QR code sessions allowing students to quickly check-in via mobile devices.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <h4>📊 Semester Summary</h4>
                <p>Generate comprehensive semester analytics detailing individual student presence and absence logs seamlessly.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <h4>🔒 Secured & Fast</h4>
                <p>Role-based protected dashboards ensuring strict data integrity, preventing unauthorized entries, and safeguarding campus records.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Meet the Project Team Section -->
    <section class="team-section">
        <h3>Meet the Project Team</h3>
        <p class="team-subtitle">The brilliant minds behind the development of this attendance portal.</p>
        <div class="team-grid">
            <!-- Student 1 -->
            <div class="team-card">
                <img src="/images/mariya.jpg" alt="Mariya Tukur Lawal">
                <h4>Mariya Tukur Lawal</h4>
                <p class="dept">Computer Science</p>
            </div>
            <!-- Student 2 -->
            <div class="team-card">
                <img src="/images/alamin.jpg" alt="Alamin Ibrahim">
                <h4>Alamin Ibrahim</h4>
                <p class="dept">Computer Science</p>
            </div>
            <!-- Student 3 -->
            <div class="team-card">
                <img src="/images/nafisa.jpg" alt="Nafisa Sabo">
                <h4>Nafisa Sabo</h4>
                <p class="dept">Computer Science</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        &copy; 2026 Federal Polytechnic, Daura (FEPODRA). All Rights Reserved.
    </footer>

</body>
</html>